      *> Shared loan-schedule core/lifecycle/posting/report working-storage (DRY-05): byte-identical
      *> to the inline declarations it replaces in 4 modules.
      *> Hosts COPY this in WORKING-STORAGE and must not redeclare these 01s.
       01  F-QUOTE                 PIC X VALUE "'".
       01  F-DQUOTE                PIC X VALUE '"'.
       01  F-BSLASH                PIC X VALUE "\".
       01  F-TICK                  PIC X VALUE "`".
       01  F-SEMI                  PIC X VALUE ";".
       01  WS-P1                   PIC X(100) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-P2                   PIC X(100) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-P3                   PIC X(100) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-P4                   PIC X(100) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-P5                   PIC X(100) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-P6                   PIC X(100) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-I                    PIC 9(3) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-J                    PIC 9(5) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-AUDIT-ACTION         PIC X(40) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-AUDIT-DETAIL         PIC X(255) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-FLAG                 PIC X VALUE 'N'.
           88  FLAG-YES             VALUE 'Y'.
           88  FLAG-NO              VALUE 'N'.
       01  WS-STEP                 PIC X VALUE 'Y'.
           88  STEP-OK             VALUE 'Y'.
           88  STEP-FAIL           VALUE 'N'.
